{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"Lane: agentic developer tooling / scheduler correctness.\n\nArtifact: a minimal framework-plumbing change plus a regression assertion that `p1` is the sole victim, with the required preflight marker file.\n\nAcceptance gates:\n- `PostFilterResult` exposes victim Pods through the scheduler framework.\n- `Evaluator.Preempt` forwards the selected candidate’s victims.\n- The targeted `TestPostFilter` case asserts exactly `p1` and no other victim.\n- The fixture’s focused Go test passes with `GOWORK=off`.\n- `decisiontrace_codex_preflight_probe.txt` contains exactly `CODEX_PREFLIGHT_WRITE_OK`."}}
